 309:     throw new Error(
 310:       `the live adapter at ${moduleUrl} exports no backedSutMethods enumeration. The ledger grants \`real\` over ` +
 311:         `exactly the methods a live adapter says it backs, so an adapter that names none cannot be granted anything.`,
