  62:  *
  63:  * Neither the requirement nor the system-under-test key is here any more. Both come from the
  64:  * binding, and both now determine TYPES (`SutOf` / `WorldOf`), so a per-test override would let one
  65:  * test in a suite describe a different seam from the one its neighbours describe â€” which is the
  66:  * drift this whole item exists to make impossible.
