 592:       const carried = await h.sentinels.plant('notification-body', 'conformance/carried/1767225600001');
 593:       const neverFired = await h.sentinels.plant('notification-body', 'conformance/absent/1767225600002');
 594: 
 595:       // ABSENCE, from a scope that is real and was searched. This is the assertion the whole design
 596:       // of scan() turns on: before it can mean anything, "not there" has to be distinguishable from
 597:       // "did not look", and the refusal at the end of this test is what makes it so.
