+/**
+ * POSITIVE GROUNDS ARE A ROUND TRIP THAT HAPPENED, NEVER A SHAPE THAT LOOKS RIGHT.
+ *
+ * `localStackProblems()` in `runner.ts` checks that a URL points at the loopback address on the
